```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization members history --help
List organization membership history

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization members history [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug

Options:
      --limit <LIMIT>        Maximum items to return (1-200)
      --cursor <CURSOR>      Opaque continuation cursor
      --json                 Print the organization result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

Authorization:
  Only an active organization owner can list membership history.

Pagination:
  This command returns one page. Pass --cursor <CURSOR> to continue.

```
